; lib_audio: the author's playground's software synthesizer and the
; formats sounds and songs are kept in (docs/plans/plan_audio.md), in
; its folders:
;   signal/     the samples, and what is computed on them (Signal, Mix,
;               Resample)
;   synthesis/  the building blocks of a sound (Oscillator, Noise, Fm,
;               Pluck, Envelope, Filter)
;   here        the engine: a sound as a tree rendered ahead (Synth, Sfx,
;               Pitch_effect), tunes (Music), stereo (Space), the sounds
;               playing (Mixer), what is played live (Instrument, Control)
;   formats/    abc, wav, midi, mod, mpeg_audio, vorbis: a file to its
;               notes or its samples
;   instruments/  what is played live: oscillators, filters, a
;               sequencer (mini-rebirth's)
;   effects/    a delay, a drive, a compressor
; copied (each file says). The folders are folders only: one library.
(include_subdirs unqualified)

(library
 (name ix_audio)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries ix_random ix_core))
